    "body": "I ended up going for this order on Unix-like operating systems:\r\n\r\n1. /etc/starship.toml\r\n2. /usr/local/etc/starship.toml\r\n3. ~/.config/starship.toml (unchanged)\r\n\r\nand this order for Windows:\r\n1. %ProgramData%\\starship.toml\r\n2. %AppData%\\starship.toml\r\n3. %HomeDrive%%HomePath%\\\\.config\\\\starship.toml (unchanged)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
